<%- include('partials/header', { title: '3D Thermal Stress Observatory', bodyClass: 'landing' }) %>
<%- include('partials/navbar') %>

<main class="landing-main">
  <!-- Hero Section with 3D Globe -->
  <section class="hero-3d-layout">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-kicker">
        <i data-lucide="shield-alert" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></i>
        Personalized Human Thermal-Stress Monitoring
      </div>
      <h1>
        The heat is the same for everyone.<br>
        <span class="gradient-text">The risk is not.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        HeatWatch models real-time biometric climate vulnerability. By computing environmental UTCI 
        from raw physical radiation, vapour pressure, and wind — then fusing it with your exposure profile into 
        a personalized <strong>HTSI</strong> score.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">
          <i data-lucide="sparkles" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i>Create your profile
        </a>
        <a class="btn" href="/login">
          <i data-lucide="user" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i>Citizen portal
        </a>
        <a class="btn" href="/government">
          <i data-lucide="map" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i>Government GIS
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3D Interactive Globe Canvas Container -->
    <div class="globe-wrapper">
      <div id="hero-globe-container"></div>
      <div class="globe-badge">
        <i data-lucide="orbit" style="width:14px;height:14px;"></i>
        <span>Drag to rotate 3D thermal globe</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3D Pipeline & Architecture Flow -->
  <section class="pipeline-section" aria-label="How HeatWatch works">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Scientific Telemetry Pipeline</h2>
      <p class="dash-sub">From physical atmospheric variables to personalized biometeorological risk</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pipeline-grid">
      <div class="flow-card card-3d">
        <span class="flow-step-num">01</span>
        <div class="flow-card-icon"><i data-lucide="cloud-sun" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></i></div>
        <strong>Atmosphere</strong>
        <p>Live solar irradiance, 10m wind speed, dry-bulb temperature, and relative humidity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-card card-3d">
        <span class="flow-step-num">02</span>
        <div class="flow-card-icon"><i data-lucide="thermometer" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></i></div>
        <strong>UTCI Index</strong>
        <p>Mean Radiant Temperature (Tmrt) and vapour pressure fused into universal thermal climate stress.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-card card-3d">
        <div class="flow-card-icon"><i data-lucide="user-check" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></i></div>
        <span class="flow-step-num">03</span>
        <strong>Vulnerability</strong>
        <p>Your work exertion, outdoor exposure hours, age, hydration, and preexisting health conditions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-card card-3d">
        <span class="flow-step-num">04</span>
        <div class="flow-card-icon"><i data-lucide="gauge" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></i></div>
        <strong>HTSI Score</strong>
        <p>Monotone human thermal stress index mapped to 5 transparent, actionable risk tiers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-card card-3d">
        <span class="flow-step-num">05</span>
        <div class="flow-card-icon"><i data-lucide="bell-ring" style="width:22px;height:22px;"></i></div>
        <strong>Alerts &amp; GIS</strong>
        <p>Proactive heat-stress advisories for citizens and tactical regional hotspot surveillance for officials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-highlight-box">
      <i data-lucide="info" style="width:28px;height:28px;color:var(--shade);flex-shrink:0;"></i>
      <p>
        <strong>The HeatWatch Principle:</strong> Same environment &rarr; identical UTCI. Different individuals &rarr; potentially distinct HTSI. 
        Environmental stress is measured once from physical telemetry; biological risk is estimated per individual profile.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    if (window.HW_3D && window.HW_3D.initHeroGlobe) {
      window.HW_3D.initHeroGlobe('hero-globe-container');
    }
    if (window.HW_3DCARD && window.HW_3DCARD.init) {
      window.HW_3DCARD.init();
    }
  });
</script>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
